cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
  Cite the Global Burden of Disease estimates themselves with the citation
  required by the Institute for Health Metrics and Evaluation (IHME), which the
  application shows alongside the data.
title: Global Health Evidence
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Zubair
    family-names: Kabir
    affiliation: School of Public Health, University College Cork
  - given-names: Abdul
    family-names: Razak
abstract: >-
  A secure, multi-country pipeline and analysis application for Global Burden
  of Disease indicators, launching with Ireland, developed at the School of
  Public Health, University College Cork. Dr. Zubair Kabir is the Principal
  Investigator and Public Health Lead. Abdul Razak, PhD, is the Technical Lead
  and Lead Developer.
repository-code: "https://github.com/abdulrazakucc/ireland-gbd-dashboard"
keywords:
  - Global Burden of Disease
  - public health
  - epidemiology
  - data pipeline
  - forecasting
